    "Today is Sunday, and the weather is very nice. Xiaoming and I go to a store. There are a great many things in the store, and the clothes all look nice. I see a new piece of clothing, and it is so beautiful! I ask Xiaoming, \"How much is it?\" Xiaoming takes a look and says, \"Three hundred yuan. That's too expensive!\" I am a little unhappy. Xiaoming says, \"Let's go to the supermarket.\" The fruit at the supermarket is very cheap. We buy apples and bread, and they are both delicious."
  ],
